    <othernotes>Please be sure to target felicia_fe when setting up targeted lines to her, don't target the Darkstalkers Felicia by mistake!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Targeting Guide:&lt;br&gt;- Felicia and her twin sister Flora are from the Ice Tribe. We know little about the Ice Tribe in or out of universe, but there are various tribes like that in the setting. Nohr is the nation she was a part of when Felicia and Flora were taken as political hostages and made to work as maids by force to prevent an uprising; Felicia seems to be ignorant, or in denial, about this.&lt;br&gt;- Felicia works really hard to be a maid, but is naturally clumsy and just generally bad at her job. She will fail to bring you a cup of tea several times in a row level clumsiness.&lt;br&gt;- However, Felicia is passionate about her work and works herself ragged, partially because she has to do every task multiple times.&lt;br&gt;- Felicia is also a very skilled combatant, especially with knives. She shows signs of being tactically gifted and may even make a fierce General one day.&lt;br&gt;- Felicia has access to Ice magic, but not to a strong extent, unlike her sister Flora who is noted to be much better at using it. Felicia can, for example, take away a fever from someone and give it to herself, and has mundane uses for it in the form of an ice tray (to carry cold food or drinks).&lt;br&gt;- Although she is self-conscious of her mistakes, Felicia doesn't like being talked down to and has a feisty side.&lt;br&gt;- Felicia occasionally makes double entendres or suggestive comments without realizing it, and is generally easy to fluster when directly flirted with.&lt;br&gt;</othernotes>
